WEBVTT

00:25:28.030 --> 00:25:30.286
anything else is a piece of cake.

00:25:30.310 --> 00:25:33.128
We're going to be stronger
for making our way through this.

00:25:33.740 --> 00:25:36.216
AG: COVID-19 has created
unprecedented challenges

00:25:36.240 --> 00:25:37.966
for the travel industry.

00:25:37.990 --> 00:25:41.706
In times like these, hospitality
is needed more than ever.

00:25:41.730 --> 00:25:44.376
Hilton hotels all around
the world are coming together

00:25:44.400 --> 00:25:47.426
to be the bright light
for those who need it most.

00:25:47.450 --> 00:25:50.646
Read more inspiring stories
of Hilton hospitality

00:25:50.670 --> 00:25:54.456
at newsroom.hilton.com/actsofhospitality.

00:25:55.495 --> 00:25:58.078
(Musical interlude)